{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The testing period does not represent the final quality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In a world ravaged by Kaijus, the Kaiju cracking Company came into being. As the boss of the company, you will lead a professional team to deal with Kaiju corpses, obtain precious resources, and expand the business territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kaiju Cracking: After defeating the Kaiju, organize a team to decompose it and obtain rare materials. Formulate a reasonable decomposition strategy to maximize resource utilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/crack.gif?t=1742896363\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Recruitment: Recruit various professional talents to form an efficient team. Different employees have unique skills, and reasonable matching can improve the company's operating efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/Interview.gif?t=1742896363\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Material Trading Market: Buy and sell decomposition materials in a dynamic market. Grasp the market situation, invest, and obtain huge profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/Stock.gif?t=1742896363\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, the game also provides a variety of gameplay such as research and development and upgrading, fighting Kaijus, and acquiring city assets, waiting for you to explore.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586410?t=1742896363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586410?t=174289